Package: com.hakmicapitalgroup.hcgnexus
Name: HCG Nexus
Version: 0.6.0~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: HCG Nexus, the HCG ecosystem command center: every HCG product by category with search, favorites, profiles, an evidence-based connection dashboard (Connected only after a real exchange), a development roadmap with LifeOS export, HCG System Tester device inventory import and the Package Trust Center. Read-only by default; nothing connects or runs at startup. Off after installation; enable it in Settings > HCG Nexus. Candidate build, not yet verified on a physical device.
Maintainer: Hakmi Capital Group
Author: Hakmi Capital Group
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
